{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_st02",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_st02",
  "title": "Momentary Rest",
  "storyCode": "RI-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a5d45caedba870a240937ca30bb1f3e46d9fbba38e59fb89790706c273bc2a83",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Lancet-2, I have a serious question.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "Go ahead.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Isn't your battery running low?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "Oh, don't worry about that. Before we left, the lovely Ms. Closure fitted me with a brand new, extra long-lasting battery.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "Theoretically, I could function for a week without needing a charge.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "The aircraft is also carrying spare batteries, so you don't have to worry about me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Okay.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Now where did Kay run off to? On our way back, the kiddo suddenly hopped to her feet and jetted away.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "It's true, we should be concerned about Ceobe's condition, but considering her strength and constitution, we don't need to be too concerned.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "That's true.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Hah, I'm bored.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "We fixed up the aircraft, patched up the wounded Gavial sent over, and now we've got nothing to do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "That we can't speak the local language is just a cherry on top. I should've gone to that ceremony with the Doctor.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "The aircraft is an important Rhodes Island asset, it's our responsibility to guard it well.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "I'm just saying. I mean, I'm a pilot, I know the deal with the aircraft.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "You're lucky, Lancet-2, you can just switch into sleep mode when you're bored. I was out for twelve hours yesterday, so I'm wide awake.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "Well, actually, I have no ability to feel 'boredom'.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "Although I do understand what this feeling is, Mr. Dylan. The lovely Ms. Closure complains about these things a lot. And it causes her to behave in strange ways.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "...I think about this sometimes, Lancet-2, are we totally sure you and the other bots don't have a human crammed up in there anywhere?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "We don't. My interior is a precisely-designed circuitry construct. Do you want to see?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "Although, since I have been programmed with a female personality, I may act out in unexpected ways when presenting my body to the opposite sex.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Err, I'll pass.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "If was going to see anything, I'd definitely prefer a swimsuit at a time like this.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "A swimsuit?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Yeah, it's summertime. That's when you put on a swimsuit and go play in the water.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "In that case, I'll play an audio recording of various sea sounds for you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "No thanks, it'd only make me feel worse.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "...Then maybe... Mr. Dylan would like to see me in a swimsuit?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Definitely not!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "Oh, sorry. I am only a robot, after all.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Err, I'm the one who's sorry. I didn't mean it like that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "Don't worry about it. By the way, have you seen the sea, Mr. Dylan?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Um, I have. I'm thinking it was that time we loaned Master SilverAsh an aircraft last summer after a schedule change mixed things up. I flew him there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "It turns out, the place was a major vacation spot. Master SilverAsh made me a VIP guest.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Man, that's when I realized how us poor folks could scarcely imagine what the rich live like.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Here, I've got the pictures with me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "You long for this kind of life, Mr. Dylan?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Hm? I mean... that was a really great couple of days, but if my whole life was like that, I don't think I'd ever get used to it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "I'm more of an instant-noodles-in-the-cockpit kind of guy. With an inverted sleep schedule to boot.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "Oh you can't do that. Let me formulate a healthy lifestyle plan for you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "No thanks, I'm good!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "Too bad. The lovely Ms. Closure created this feature for me, but no one uses it. Not her, not the Doctor.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Haha, sounds about right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Oh, but that reminds me, the tribes here live so much better than I thought. They really want for nothing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "Yes, life here is less convenient and comfortable than the world we know, but not to any significant degree.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "According to my records, your health has improved in the past two days.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Really?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "Really.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Turns out returning to nature will do that for you. Heh. I guess this is the life that everyone came from.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Oh yeah, I just remembered, Gavial said something about a gigantic waterfall in the rainforest that way. I'd love to go there when the Doctor gets back.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "They may have already gone that way.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "The Doctor is a good boss. And I know our friends wouldn't abandon us to go play under the waterfall!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "text": "True. Then let's wait patiently.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "text": "Is there a 'Dylan' here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "That's me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Huh? You speak Sargonian?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "Yes. And you're here with the machine. Right, it must be you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "The one called 'Doctor' asked me to give you this note.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "Hm? Let's see here...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dylan",
      "text": "...Lancet-2, looks like we've got work to do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "Wow! I could hear the roar of the water from so far away, I never knew waterfalls even got this big!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Hah, I didn't steer you wrong, did I?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "Sure enough. I guess I'll forgive you~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Haha! It really is an incredible waterfall.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "Looks like Tomimi isn't here yet, so let's take a little break.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "Hooray! I can finally get some use out of my swimsuit~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flint",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "You got a lotta fight in you, squirt.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Flint",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Kemar, well aware of the language barrier, communicates with her stance, rather than words."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "text": "Heh. Seeing as I've got nothing else to do, we might as well go a few rounds.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "Blaze is really going at it hard with that girl over there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Sure is.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "I don't see what's so fun about fighting.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "...I heard you singin' a whole 'nother tune last time you was fightin', Utage.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "Ahahaha. I guess you're right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "Hey, Croissant, that isn't a swimsuit, is it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Ahahaha, ya got me. It's just some outdoorsy getup I snagged. Plenty waterproof, so we'n pretend it's a swimsuit.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "You're a real function over form kinda girl, huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "But hey, it may not be a beach, but playing around a waterfall is pretty great too! It's got that real 'back to nature' vibe. Too bad I didn't bring my camera.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Ya got that right. I ain't never been out in the wilds like this before. I'm havin' a ball!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "Hey...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Whassat?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "Am I seeing things?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Utage",
      "text": "Isn't that Kay?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gavial",
      "text": "How do you like the waterfall, Doctor?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "It's nice.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "Hah, I used to love coming here to bathe.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "Looks like you've got a lot on your mind, Doctor.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Meh.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "You're cruisin' for a bruisin', Doctor.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "From here it's just a short walk to Zumama's tribe.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "When I got that letter from Tomimi, I never thought things would turn out like this.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "...Oh, Doctor, there's one thing that's been really gnawing at my brain these past few days. We're friends, right? I wanna ask you about it.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Do you think...?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "text": "Doooctooor!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "What's happening? I'm trying to talk to the Doctor here.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "text": "Look over there!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Is that... Kay?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceobe",
          "text": "I found it! The Mushroom Sea!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceobe",
          "text": "Bath time!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Looks like she's still off in la la land.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "text": "But she's just so cute rolling around in the water like that.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Gah, stupid kid.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "How about we just let her play for a while...?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Anyway, Doctor, what I wanted to ask was—",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Do you think my tail's gotten fatter?",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Yes.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "What? Really? I guess I'm going on a diet when we get back.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "Come on, Doctor, don't look at me like that. An Archosauria's tail is her most prized asset! This is my life!",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "I didn't notice.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "Pfft, I knew I shouldn't have asked you.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "You don't know, Tomimi's tail wasn't always that fat. And I don't want mine to end up like hers.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What do you think about Zumama?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "Huh? What do I think about her?",
              "portraitKey": null
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "I guess I think she's real tough, and she can make a helluva machine.",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Let's talk about tails more.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Gavial",
              "text": "I had a feeling you'd be down with tails!",
              "portraitKey": null
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Gavial!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "There's Tomimi. You done with that thing?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Yes!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "text": "Hmmmmm?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Wh-What?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "text": "You're a cutie! Gavial, I never knew you had a friend like this. I thought you just hung around with other muscleheaded lunks like you.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "That was uncalled for!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "text": "She's got perfect skin, refined features, and a gothy outfit that really goes with her complexion.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Gothy? Is that in?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "text": "Well, no. But it's popular with a certain crowd.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "I-I picked it up from a magazine. They said it's how they dress in the outside world.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "text": "Oh, no, girl, honey. You've got a critically flawed understanding of fashion here. But that's okay. I mean, look at this place. I totally get why you'd come up with something like that.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "text": "But don't worry, you just let Big Sister Utage fill you with her bottomless, extra-thick fashion wisdom!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "text": "Gavial, I'm borrowing her!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "Wha? Whaaaaaaa?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Sure, knock yourself out.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Anyway, we're all here.",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "I'll see if I can get Kay to sober up...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceobe",
          "text": "Break time's over! Kay is back in the fight!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Croissant",
          "text": "Gavial, she's makin' a break for it again!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "What?",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Gavial",
          "text": "Grr, everybody, get your clothes on! We're going after her!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Tomimi",
          "text": "That direction... it's the way to Zumama's tribe...",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "text": "Hold on! Did you really change that fast?!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Utage",
          "text": "Wait up!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "text": "Why bother changing? Just go!",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
